<cl=A2A2A2>
For many centuries, the best blacksmiths of the Sphere founded this guild. To
to reach the heights in the Guild, you need to have both a serious title and
degree. Blacksmithing requires constant attention, and in the guild
they do not practice either elemental magic or skills that could be useful
in battle. However, few people can withstand the blow of an experienced blacksmith, who received while working
behind the anvil from year to year, not only physical strength, but also
part of the magic he learned from the objects he worked with. As well as Gunsmiths,
Blacksmiths are recognized masters of their craft, and only the brand of the Guild can
serve as a guarantee of the quality of armor in the Sphere.

<br>
